{"text":"And the marks aren't scratched into the fossil. They turned to stone along with it. Three words, carved by a human hand, sixty-six million years before there were any humans. For one second, she thinks of the boy's mother, the woman she met in front of the T. rex. Then she pushes the thought away. It's impossible. And it would be cruel. She doesn't have an answer. So the bone stays in the back room.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["A","n","d"," ","t","h","e"," ","m","a","r","k","s"," ","a","r","e","n","'","t"," ","s","c","r","a","t","c","h","e","d"," ","i","n","t","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","o","s","s","i","l","."," ","T","h","e","y"," ","t","u","r","n","e","d"," ","t","o"," ","s","t","o","n","e"," ","a","l","o","n","g"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","i","t","."," ","T","h","r","e","e"," ","w","o","r","d","s",","," ","c","a","r","v","e","d"," ","b","y"," ","a"," ","h","u","m","a","n"," ","h","a","n","d",","," ","s","i","x","t","y","-","s","i","x"," ","m","i","l","l","i","o","n"," ","y","e","a","r","s"," ","b","e","f","o","r","e"," ","t","h","e","r","e"," ","w","e","r","e"," ","a","n","y"," ","h","u","m","a","n","s","."," ","F","o","r"," ","o","n","e"," ","s","e","c","o","n","d",","," ","s","h","e"," ","t","h","i","n","k","s"," ","o","f"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","o","y","'","s"," ","m","o","t","h","e","r",","," ","t","h","e"," ","w","o","m","a","n"," ","s","h","e"," ","m","e","t"," ","i","n"," ","f","r","o","n","t"," ","o","f"," ","t","h","e"," ","T","."," ","r","e","x","."," ","T","h","e","n"," ","s","h","e"," ","p","u","s","h","e","s"," ","t","h","e"," ","t","h","o","u","g","h","t"," ","a","w","a","y","."," ","I","t","'","s"," ","i","m","p","o","s","s","i","b","l","e","."," ","A","n","d"," ","i","t"," ","w","o","u","l","d"," ","b","e"," ","c","r","u","e","l","."," ","S","h","e"," ","d","o","e","s","n","'","t"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","a","n"," ","a","n","s","w","e","r","."," ","S","o"," ","t","h","e",